# Agent Gateway: local admin settings. Copy to .env (gitignored); never commit .env.
#
# AGW_ADMIN_TOKEN is filled in automatically:
#   - `agw init` writes the first admin token here,
#   - `agw token create --admin` replaces it with a new one,
#   - `agw-onboard-ssh` offers to save a token you type in.
# `agw-onboard-ssh` reads it from here, so you are not asked for it every time.
# Anyone who can read this value is a gateway admin: keep the file private.
AGW_ADMIN_TOKEN=
